Di project Laravel CMS ini, endpoint GET /api/v2/pages/{slug} sudah pakai cache()->rememberForever tapi tiap request tetap jalan belasan query menurut debugbar. Ini kode controllernya:

public function getPage($slug)
{
    $data = cache()->rememberForever(
        config('cache.cache_post_resource') . $slug . '_' . $this->locale . '_v2',
        function () use ($slug) {
            $post = $this->postService->findBySlug($slug, PostType::PAGE->value);
            if (!$post) return null;
            return new PostResource($post);
        }
    );
    if (!$data) return ApiResponse::error('Error not found', 404);
    return ApiResponse::json($data);
}

Kenapa cache-nya ngk works dan gimana benerinnya?
